# Cloudflare Pages already 308s *.html → extensionless and serves the .html file.
# Never add the reverse (extensionless → *.html) or you get a redirect loop.
# /404.html is required. Without a top-level 404.html, Pages serves index.html
# at 200 for every unknown path (SPA fallback), including /sitemap_index.xml.
/stack /physical-stack 301